export anchor TestErrors:
    description:
        A project with no tests is reported and succeeds. Targets and tags
        that select no tests, and a target that matches no test by name, file
        or directory, are errors. A tool that is not on PATH is an error naming it,
        with a suggestion to choose another with `--agent`, and nothing is
        run. `--jobs` with `--serial` is an error, since they disagree, and so
        is a jobs value below 1.
